# Run output. Nothing under results/ is committed: a ledger is only meaningful
# beside the traces and manifest that produced it, and those are hundreds of MB
# per matrix. Published runs go out as a separate corpus, per spec §6.4
# deliverable 6 — not as repo history.
results/
traces/

